Z||000007||Oreif||11-28-2001||02:20 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DRH:<BR><B>I just re-read the description of the virus. The message must have come from someone that you sent a message to with the same title (probably without the first "RE"). If you can figure out who that is, you should warn them.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It will also make up it's own subject title's.<BR>Click on this link to see exactly what the virus does, What area's of the computer it infects, And where to look/how get rid of it.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.f-secure.com/v-descs/badtrs_b.shtml" TARGET=_blank>http://www.f-secure.com/v-descs/badtrs_b.shtml</A><P>The following link will tell you how to get rid of it.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.europe.f-secure.com/v-descs/bt_b_dis.shtml" TARGET=_blank>http://www.europe.f-secure.com/v-descs/bt_b_dis.shtml</A>   <P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 11-28-2001).]||||reg||1
