Z||000020||Oreif||11-28-2001||07:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>So you're saying that I can't get the virus if I have OE6 (which I happen to have)???  This virus is all I need to finish off my week.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No, what it means is if you get an Email it will NOT automatically infect your computer. BUT if you click on the attachment it will infect the computer. So Don't click on the attachments unless you are 110% sure it's not a virus. You could also download a virus scanner. Many allow you to scan attachments prior to opening them.<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">          <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||1
