Z||000024||CoolBlue87GT||11-30-2001||11:34 PM||||Re: Badtrans<P>My computer got a virus from the email greeting card company. -- (I think.)<P>I sent out a greeting to friends, and not knowingly sent them a virus.<P>It was named something like win32.Badtrans.29020 - supposted to be a new & really bad virus. It sends to all in the address book, without any knowledge of the user.<P>I got messages from companies Maryland & and Ft. Worth that my computer had sent them an email with a virus.<P>My virus program did not detect it !<P>I now have a different virus program in place.<P>You all might want to invest in an updated copy of a virus check program.<P>- I had McAfee Vshield , still let it run in the backround.<P>Now I use InoculateIT Real-Time for internet protection, and for e-mail "Mail Watcher"<P>I hate those that 'get off' on creating these virus programs. <BR> ||||reg||9
